      },
      {
        "id": "blk_abc0b7381aa1a554e2bedbf6",
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "text": "生产故障响应的提交期限为19个工作日。",
        "anchor": {
          "kind": "document_block",
          "block_index": 1
        },
        "style": "Heading 2"
      },
      {
        "id": "blk_09cd1b78c334841d49516e51",
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "text": "生产故障响应的审批责任人为可靠性团队。",
        "anchor": {
          "kind": "document_block",
          "block_index": 2
        },
        "style": "Normal"
      },
      {
        "id": "blk_0f451bb1acf3ec201104727a",
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "text": "生产故障响应必须提供故障时间线。",
        "anchor": {
          "kind": "document_block",
          "block_index": 3
        },
        "style": "Normal"
      },
      {
        "id": "blk_d3fd50a56f8fefd38d914f7a",
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "text": "生产故障响应记录须保留13个月。",
        "anchor": {
          "kind": "document_block",
          "block_index": 4
        },
        "style": "Normal"
      },
      {
        "id": "blk_7c52742a272040a459e1baa3",
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "text": "生产故障响应的紧急例外需要部门负责人书面批准。",
        "anchor": {
          "kind": "document_block",
          "block_index": 5
        },
        "style": "Normal"
      },
      {
        "id": "blk_c220ab8ba2b62f7d29e840ac",
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "text": "生产故障响应必须通过故障频道提交。",
        "anchor": {
          "kind": "document_block",
          "block_index": 6
        },
        "style": "Normal"
